    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract shard-node admission and accounting policy for ThemisDB distributed clustering. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defines the policy contract that governs how many shard nodes the runtime is allowed to operate concurrently. Analogous to IVRAMPolicy for GPU memory budgets — both interfaces feed into EditionManager&apos;s resource-limit checks and can be installed at runtime by signed edition-upgrade plugins. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
